From: EvilMetaMonkey <hood.mj85@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:19:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Document per-file policy drift and checkpoint export

AGENTS.md records the drift rule, schema 5 and the export command (with
the note that exports hold only protected files, so bisect must set up
ignored dependencies). docs/HAVEN-INTEGRATION.md lists the additive
JSON: closePolicyFingerprint, file scope, the plan's skipped list and
the export result. The website's checkpoints page, README, CHANGELOG
and STATUS.md are updated; the policy_changed item leaves Broken.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
